  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Considering Font Loading**\n\nI\'m currently focused on font loading for the project\'s visual design. Specifically, I\'m examining the efficient integration of Google Fonts like Inter and Plus Jakarta Sans within the `index.html` file. I\'m also exploring using `lucide-react` icons and/or Material Symbols Outlined. The objective is to achieve a crisp, modern user experience, as inspired by the HTML design.\n\n\n**Analyzing Color Palette**\n\nI\'ve been evaluating the color palette, focusing on primary, surface, on-surface, primary-fixed, and tertiary colors, settling on variations like #006b2c, #f8f9ff, and #0b1c30. I\'m also planning to utilize the \"FreshCart GROCERY & INVENTORY\" logo, and I\'ve started the process of verifying the `metadata.json` file. Updating its name and description seems like a good starting point before I move on.\n\n\n**Designing Storefront Features**\n\nI\'m now diving into the storefront view design. I\'m focusing on key elements like the cart button with a live item count badge, a user avatar with a profile dropdown, and a secondary aisle bar. I\'m also considering a promo coupon ribbon and a real-time inventory sync ticker. The hero section is getting attention too, with the badge, title, subtitle, and search bar being the current focus. I\'m also planning trending tags in the search bar.\n\n\n**Developing Product Listing**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in the product listing section. Specifically, I\'m fleshing out the design and functionality. I\'m focusing on \"Shop by Fresh Category\" cards, with options for Fruits & Veg, Dairy & Eggs, and more. A \"Featured Harvest & Daily Goods\" section is also taking shape. I\'m prioritizing the presentation of product cards, including images, stock badges, categories, suppliers, and pricing. I\'m aiming for seamless filtering. The interactive quantity stepper and \"Add to Cart\" function are also in development.\n\n\n**Constructing Cart Functionality**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the interactive cart button and the corresponding drawer. I\'m focusing on the floating button\'s visual cues and the drawer\'s content, including item listings, a subtotal, a progress bar for free delivery, and discount application. I\'m also planning the checkout button, the trust banner, and the footer.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 4
      nanos: 514920593
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
