  planner_response {
    response: "I have built the **FreshCart Grocery & Inventory** application matching the provided screens, typography, design tokens, and hotlinked assets.\n\n### Key Features & Experiences\n\n- **Retail Storefront**:\n  - **Live Header & Navigation**: Features the FreshCart brand logo, delivery location selector (*Downtown Supercenter \302\267 30m*), global search with instant filtering, cart button with real-time count badges, and user profile avatar.\n  - **Secondary Aisle Bar**: Quick-filtering navigation across *All Aisles*, *Fruits & Veggies*, *Dairy & Eggs*, *Bakery & Bread*, *Beverages*, *Snacks & Organic*, and *Rice, Pasta & Grains*.\n  - **Promotional Ribbon & Ticker**: Active coupon banner for **`FRESH30`** (with one-click auto-apply) and real-time MongoDB CDC cluster synchronization indicator with cold-chain validation metrics.\n  - **Hero Showcase**: High-impact display with direct search, trending tags (*Honeycrisp Apples*, *Artisan Sourdough*, *Hass Avocados*), and the floating Cold-Chain Speed Hub card (*Packed within 7 mins at 4\302\260C*).\n  - **Curated Catalog & Categories**: Six interactive category cards displaying item counts and one-click filtering.\n  - **Featured Harvest & Daily Goods**: High-resolution produce cards with live stock status indicators (*In Stock*, *Low Stock*, and *Out of Stock*), farm supplier and SKU details, unit steppers, quick add-to-cart, and restock notification alerts.\n  - **Interactive Floating Cart Drawer**: Bottom-right floating toggle opening an interactive live basket, free express delivery goal tracker ($25.00 goal with progress bar), item quantity steppers, promo coupon entry with discount calculation, and order total.\n  - **Express 30-Minute Checkout Modal**: Complete order checkout with delivery instructions, payment method selection, and simulated 3-step live order dispatch tracking.\n  - **Product Detail Modal**: Clickable product view showing farm origin, harvest timestamps, cold-chain temperature tolerances, and nutritional profiles.\n\n- **Store Operations & Admin Portal**:\n  - Accessible via the **Admin Portal** button in the header or the footer.\n  - Features operations overview with KPIs for active SKUs, cold-chain pod temperature (3.8\302\260C), stock alerts, and picker stats.\n  - Real-time inventory table allowing live stock adjustments, inline price editing, and single-click restocks.\n  - **Simulate MongoDB CDC Pulse** button demonstrating live stock synchronization between store batches and shopper carts."
    thinking: "**Verifying Successful Build**\n\nI\'ve got good news! The initial build completed flawlessly and immediately. Now, I\'m meticulously checking the details to ensure everything aligns with the user\'s request. Specifically, I am cross-referencing all aspects of the instructions, starting with the prompt, and making sure all components of the build are validated. The first image has been checked to the correct upload.\n\n\n**Validating Asset Integration**\n\nI\'m now fully immersed in validating the asset integration. I\'ve confirmed Image 2 (SVG logo, dark), Image 3 (Sarah L. portrait), and Image 4 (full desktop screenshot) have been uploaded and correctly linked in the provided HTML. I\'m carefully cross-referencing all components, especially the data tokens and style integration. I\'m moving through this by cross-referencing this against the full feature set. The storefront is being meticulously tested.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have built the **FreshCart Grocery & Inventory** application matching the provided screens, typography, design tokens, and hotlinked assets.\n\n### Key Features & Experiences\n\n- **Retail Storefront**:\n  - **Live Header & Navigation**: Features the FreshCart brand logo, delivery location selector (*Downtown Supercenter \302\267 30m*), global search with instant filtering, cart button with real-time count badges, and user profile avatar.\n  - **Secondary Aisle Bar**: Quick-filtering navigation across *All Aisles*, *Fruits & Veggies*, *Dairy & Eggs*, *Bakery & Bread*, *Beverages*, *Snacks & Organic*, and *Rice, Pasta & Grains*.\n  - **Promotional Ribbon & Ticker**: Active coupon banner for **`FRESH30`** (with one-click auto-apply) and real-time MongoDB CDC cluster synchronization indicator with cold-chain validation metrics.\n  - **Hero Showcase**: High-impact display with direct search, trending tags (*Honeycrisp Apples*, *Artisan Sourdough*, *Hass Avocados*), and the floating Cold-Chain Speed Hub card (*Packed within 7 mins at 4\302\260C*).\n  - **Curated Catalog & Categories**: Six interactive category cards displaying item counts and one-click filtering.\n  - **Featured Harvest & Daily Goods**: High-resolution produce cards with live stock status indicators (*In Stock*, *Low Stock*, and *Out of Stock*), farm supplier and SKU details, unit steppers, quick add-to-cart, and restock notification alerts.\n  - **Interactive Floating Cart Drawer**: Bottom-right floating toggle opening an interactive live basket, free express delivery goal tracker ($25.00 goal with progress bar), item quantity steppers, promo coupon entry with discount calculation, and order total.\n  - **Express 30-Minute Checkout Modal**: Complete order checkout with delivery instructions, payment method selection, and simulated 3-step live order dispatch tracking.\n  - **Product Detail Modal**: Clickable product view showing farm origin, harvest timestamps, cold-chain temperature tolerances, and nutritional profiles.\n\n- **Store Operations & Admin Portal**:\n  - Accessible via the **Admin Portal** button in the header or the footer.\n  - Features operations overview with KPIs for active SKUs, cold-chain pod temperature (3.8\302\260C), stock alerts, and picker stats.\n  - Real-time inventory table allowing live stock adjustments, inline price editing, and single-click restocks.\n  - **Simulate MongoDB CDC Pulse** button demonstrating live stock synchronization between store batches and shopper carts."
